        ],
        "text": "The case concerns a court order requiring California to release between 36,000 and 45,000 inmates within a two\u2011year period."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Specter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0002-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 48,
              "start": 48
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Specter, the state argues that increasing good\u2011time credits can help reduce prison crowding."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Specter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0002-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 41,
              "start": 41
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The prison population has declined by about 10,000 prisoners."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Phillips",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0004-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 78,
              "start": 78
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The plaintiffs argue that the state can implement a plan that would release about 16,000 inmates without additional legislation, but would need legislation for further reductions."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Phillips",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0004-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 80,
              "start": 80
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The district court ordered the state to achieve a 137.5\u202f% capacity level within two years."
      }
    ],
